{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339990/extras/7113845c686f805aa502a29f8c4c2837.poster.avif?t=1769615191\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339990/extras/7113845c686f805aa502a29f8c4c2837.webm?t=1769615191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339990/extras/7113845c686f805aa502a29f8c4c2837.mp4?t=1769615191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Goblin Lair its a fast-paced strategic clicker! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash your mouse like a maniac to gather crystals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources wisely, recruit goblins, build your base and strengthen your warriors. Expand your base, enhance your clicks or automate your miners as you fend off relentless enemy raids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339990/extras/9ced561384d0409c3a56d601033a8532.poster.avif?t=1769615191\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339990/extras/9ced561384d0409c3a56d601033a8532.webm?t=1769615191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339990/extras/9ced561384d0409c3a56d601033a8532.mp4?t=1769615191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click and Mine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig faster than your goblins can count!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta